<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Energy Africa yr shr boosted by exceps.</title>
<headline>Energy Africa yr shr boosted by exceps.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended August 31 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr:</p>
<p>    - incl exceps.    608.5	vs    14.5</p>
<p>    - excl exceps	 7.9 loss vs     0.5 profit</p>
<p>    Attrib income     459.75     vs    8.20</p>
<p>    Pre-tax	     461.25     vs   10.35</p>
<p>    Tax		    11.21     vs    2.15</p>
<p>    Turnover	    154.20     vs  110.29</p>
<p>    Exceptionals (*)  465.69     vs    8.66</p>
<p>Full name: Energy Africa Ltd</p>
<p>(*) Exceptional gain results from cancellation of parent company indebtednss and gain on disposal of licences.</p>
<p>NOTE - The former upstream arm of Engen Ltd, with interests in West and Southern Africa, was floated on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange in March 1996.</p>
<p>Engen has a stake of 60.5 percent in Energy Africa.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
